{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Nz4cUsDTWqsmGen1EeJgo8","type":"tool_result","content":"Yes, `DO_NOT_TRACK` is mentioned. Telemetry can be disabled in four ways:\n\n1. **CLI command:** \"If you would like to disable telemetry, you can run:\" followed by `npx wrangler telemetry disable`.\n2. **Per-project config:** Add `send_metrics=false` to the project's wrangler.toml file.\n3. **Environment variable:** Set `WRANGLER_SEND_METRICS=false`. The page introduces this with \"Alternatively, you may set an environment variable to disable telemetry.\"\n4. **`DO_NOT_TRACK`:** \"Wrangler also honors the `DO_NOT_TRACK` environment variable. Set it to `1` to disable telemetry:\" The page adds that \"`DO_NOT_TRACK=1` takes precedence over all other telemetry settings.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e312f49c-b5ff-41a0-849a-ef81921c95d1","uuid":"9e6e3bf5-c676-41e4-9e63-a3141377c03d","timestamp":"2026-10-11T10:42:51.878Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":5155,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"Yes, `DO_NOT_TRACK` is mentioned. Telemetry can be disabled in four ways:\n\n1. **CLI command:** \"If you would like to disable telemetry, you can run:\" followed by `npx wrangler telemetry disable`.\n2. **Per-project config:** Add `send_metrics=false` to the project's wrangler.toml file.\n3. **Environment variable:** Set `WRANGLER_SEND_METRICS=false`. The page introduces this with \"Alternatively, you may set an environment variable to disable telemetry.\"\n4. **`DO_NOT_TRACK`:** \"Wrangler also honors the `DO_NOT_TRACK` environment variable. Set it to `1` to disable telemetry:\" The page adds that \"`DO_NOT_TRACK=1` takes precedence over all other telemetry settings.\"","durationMs":4741,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/main/packages/wrangler/telemetry.md"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Nz4cUsDTWqsmGen1EeJgo8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvJzX5txWhnnGiXNF2Ut","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes. Wrangler's telemetry docs (`packages/wrangler/telemetry.md` in cloudflare/workers-sdk) say Wrangler honors `DO_NOT_TRACK`. Setting it to `1` turns telemetry off, and it overrides every other telemetry setting. The other ways to turn it off are `npx wrangler telemetry disable`, `send_metrics = false` in `wrangler.toml`, or `WRANGLER_SEND_METRICS=false`. Older Wrangler versions may not support `DO_NOT_TRACK`, so on an old release, `WRANGLER_SEND_METRICS=false` is the safer choice."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":491,"cache_read_input_tokens":22417,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":491},"output_tokens":225,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e312f49c-b5ff-41a0-849a-ef81921c95d1","uuid":"70322536-ed7b-45d7-82e6-9cee701a25b0","timestamp":"2026-10-11T10:42:54.760Z","request_id":"req_011CfvJzWp2mSEwQV9MGTWnu"}
